
  Z Alpine Desktop (x86)  --  32-bit Alpine Linux for the v86 emulator

  desktop  XFCE on Xorg, display :0, 1024x768, LightDM autologin as z
  login    z / z   (passwordless sudo; root login is disabled)
  agent    zguest on 127.0.0.1:5555   rc-service zguest status
  share    /mnt/host = the emulator's 9p share (tag host9p), when provided
  tools    xdotool, scrot, xclip, python3, curl, netsurf-gtk3
  network  eth0 via DHCP; after a state restore run: z-net-reset
  more     sudo apk add <package>   (main + community)

